  "comment": "Seasonal quests: time-limited campaigns, each a chain of quests taken on one after another (GetSeasonalQuests lists the one the player is on in each). A calendar is the advent calendar the client draws for campaigns starting with seasonalQuestCalendar.campaignPrefix: one campaign a day from startsOn (UTC), its quest's sort order the day, open until endsOn; its days pay reward activity points of activityPointType (101 snowflakes, seasonalQuestCalendar.currency). Texts are quests.<campaign>.<code>.*. The bawcollab campaigns are habbo.com's (SeasonalQuestsMessage, 25 Oct 2026: their first quests, 2094 and 2095, and their end); the later quest ids are ours. The xmas2013 days come from the external texts (quests.xmas2013_*); their ids and types are ours: Habbo judged most in its Santa's Workshop rooms, so FIND_STUFF stands for 'the room's wired says so'. steps defaults to 1.",
